	(text "OPEN (v0.0)\n- ES8388 reference caps: 10u + 100n each on VREF / ADCVREF / VMID. Check against the datasheet figure.\n- LP5907MFX-3.3: LCSC part and stock to check (or another low-noise 3.3 V LDO in SOT-23-5).\n- OLED module: measure the outline, header and active area; then draw CVSpeak:OLED_SH1106_1.3in_SPI_7pin.\n- LCSC numbers marked NEW in build_sch.py: verify.\n- Layout: codec and audio op-amp away from the buck; one ground plane, codec AGND and DGND tied under the chip."
